	<text xml:lang="la">
		<body>
			<div>
				<p>
					<s n="1" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z1"/>S.</s>
					<s n="2" xml:lang="la">Tandem sessiones illę <placeName ref="l1107">Tridentinę</placeName> etiam ad me venerunt hac conditione, ut ego remittam.</s>
					<s n="3" xml:lang="la">Age, remitto; <lb xml:id="p1z2"/>casu enim occurrerunt <placeName ref="l587">Tigurini</placeName> illi filio.</s>
					<s n="4" xml:lang="la">Hic ego statim: "Remittenda sunt, quę <persName ref="p1278">Gastius</persName> commisit, qualis<lb xml:id="p1z3"/>qualis ille fuerit erga te."</s>
					<s n="5" xml:lang="la">Non legi, sed describi feci, lecturus, dum fuerit occasio.</s>
					<s n="6" xml:lang="la">Canones vidi tamen <lb xml:id="p1z4"/>de eucharistia et indignatus sum, ut reliqua abiicerem.</s>
					<s n="7" xml:lang="la">Ibi proverbium: Ex ungue leonem, <lb xml:id="p1z5"/>clarius cognovi.</s>
					<s n="8" xml:lang="la">Bestię sunt diabolicę; a diabolo nanque gubernantur, quantumvis laudentur in <lb xml:id="p1z6"/>dialogis <persName>Nauseę</persName> plerique, inprimis tamen ille de <placeName>Crescentiis</placeName>.</s>
					<s n="9" xml:lang="la">Sed habet suum premium; mortuus est enim <lb xml:id="p1z7"/>et e vestigio abductus domum.</s>
					<s n="10" xml:lang="la">Ita scripsit e <placeName ref="l1107">Tridento</placeName> bonus quidam.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="11" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z8"/>Cęsar cum <placeName ref="l491">Argentinensibus</placeName> cupit edere ova paschalia; nescio, si permissuri sint.</s>
					<s n="12" xml:lang="la">Vir est in maligno <lb xml:id="p1z9"/>positus; quo igitur remotior esset a me, eo foret gratior.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="13" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z10"/>Moguntia clausa est pręter duas portas.</s>
					<s n="14" xml:lang="la">Receperunt ad se 4 vexilla militum rusticanorum <placeName ref="l157">Francfordiensium</placeName><lb xml:id="p1z11"/>, sed electorum.</s>
					<s n="15" xml:lang="la"><placeName ref="l491">Argentinenses</placeName> civitatem habent militibus refertam alienis.</s>
					<s n="16" xml:lang="la">Omnes iactant Cęsarem: ego <lb xml:id="p1z12"/>vero dico: "Quid, si praemissi a Cęsareanis auxilia futuri sint Caesari, ut voto potiatur facilius in e<lb xml:id="p1z13"/>dendis placentis et ovis paschalibus?"</s>
					<s n="17" xml:lang="la">Caveant.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="18" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z14"/>Urbs nostra Germanis militibus discurrentibus repleta est; magis repleta est ditio nostra; hic enim colligun<lb xml:id="p1z15"/>tur, usque dum exeant.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="19" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z16"/>Delectum militum habuerunt <placeName ref="l3151">Rheinfeldenses</placeName> superioribus diebus.</s>
					<s n="20" xml:lang="la">Per <placeName ref="l2836">Sungaudiam</placeName> per campanas vocarunt ad <lb xml:id="p1z17"/>arma rusticos; clamabant <persName ref="p2916">Schertlium</persName> adesse cum exercitu.</s>
					<s n="21" xml:lang="la">Timent hunc ut quem maxime et tamen a<lb xml:id="p1z18"/>deo maledicunt ei, ut non mirum esset, si vel a maledictionibus obprimeretur.</s>
					<s n="22" xml:lang="la">Patitur bonus vir multas <lb xml:id="p1z19"/>iniurias et eas gravissimas.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="23" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z20"/>Sequentia in aurem tibi: filius lantgravii hic latet, dux item <placeName ref="l701">Mechelburgensis</placeName> iuvenis, et nudiustertiu<lb xml:id="p1z21"/>s advenit, qui captus erat a <placeName ref="l303">Magdeburgensibus</placeName>; ducendos iuvenes puto in <placeName ref="l832">Galliam</placeName> pro obsidibus; se<lb xml:id="p1z22"/>nior quid acturus sit, incertum.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="24" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z23"/>Literis e <placeName ref="l1107">Tridento</placeName> certior sum factus literas tuti itineris nondum datas theologis <placeName>Mauritianis</placeName>.</s>
					<s n="25" xml:lang="la">Sunt da<lb xml:id="p1z24"/>tę quędam, sed quę dissimiles sunt eis, quas <persName ref="p18250">Mauritius</persName> petivit.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="26" xml:lang="la">Quamobrem consultat una cum aliis, quid <lb xml:id="p1z25"/>amplius faciendum.</s>
					<s n="27" xml:lang="la">Verum hac de re forsitan alias.</s>
					<s n="28" xml:lang="la" ana="farewell">Vale in domino cum d. <persName ref="p8171">Theodoro</persName>, <persName ref="p8011">Gvalthero</persName>, <persName ref="p8459">O<lb xml:id="p1z26"/>thone</persName> etc.</s>
					<s n="29" xml:lang="la"><placeName ref="l28">Basileę</placeName> 18. martii ann. 1552.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="30" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z27"/>T[uus] <persName ref="p8418">Os[valdus] Myco<lb xml:id="p1z28"/>niu<lb xml:id="p1z29"/>s</persName>.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="31" xml:lang="la"><pb/><lb xml:id="p2z1"/>D. <persName ref="p495">Heinricho Bullingero</persName>, in domino suo.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="32" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p2z2"/><placeName ref="l587">Tiguri</placeName>.</s>
				</p>
			</div>
		</body>
